<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Jan wholesale prices up 15.74 yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Jan wholesale prices up 15.74 yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's wholesale price index rose 15.74 percent in January year-on-year, compared to 14.41 percent in December, the Federal Bureau of Statistics said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The index, using 1990/91 as base year, rose 2.3 percent to 204.12 from 199.53 in December 1996. The index stood at 176.36 in January 1996.</p>
<p>					  Jan	Dec	   Jan 1996</p>
<p>WHOLESALE PRICE  base 1990/91  204.12   199.53	  176.36</p>
<p>    Month-on-month		  +2.30    +1.39	    n/a</p>
<p>    Year-on-year		   +15.74   +14.41	    n/a</p>
<p>-- Islamabad newsroom 9251-274757</p>
